    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- YouTube Daily Views -->
  <section class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">YouTube Daily Views</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Feb 11 – Mar 11, 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative h-52">
      <canvas id="ytDailyChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TikTok Daily Views -->
  <section class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">TikTok Daily Views</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Jan 18 – Mar 10, 2026 · 50 active days</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative h-52">
      <canvas id="tiktokDailyChart"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-400">
      <strong class="text-white">Key insights:</strong> Launched Jan 18, 2026 with 76 views. Peak performance Feb 13 (1,071 views). Strong engagement: 257 likes, 20 comments, 11 shares across 50 active days.
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Recommendations -->
  <section class="bg-gray-900 border border-amber-700 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400">Strategic Recommendations</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">Data-driven priorities based on cross-platform analysis</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">YouTube · High Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">"Thought for the Day" Shorts are the growth engine</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Shorts dominate views (Shorts feed = 63% of all views, 11,468 views). "Pray for Israel" hit 999 views in days. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Increase Shorts cadence from ~2–3/week to daily. Each Short should have a hook in the first 2 seconds and a clear title format (e.g., "What is X? | Thought #N").</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">YouTube · High Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Timely current-events videos break out</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">"Reflections on US/Israel-Iran" got 728 views with 58.9 hrs watch time in 28 days — highest watch time of any long-form. Purim 2026 hit 69 hrs. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Prioritize timely topic videos (Jewish news, world events with a Torah lens). These earn disproportionate browse/search traffic.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-green-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Podcast · High Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Friday release timing drives the biggest spikes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Parasha episodes (released Fridays) consistently spike 2–3× the weekly baseline. The podcast grew from 22 followers (Oct 2022) to 1,106 (Mar 2026) — 50× in 3.5 years. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Protect the Friday release slot as the anchor. Consider Thursday "teaser clip" on YouTube that links to the full episode.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-green-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Podcast · Medium Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Apple Podcasts is underserved vs. Spotify</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Apple Podcasts holds 31.8% of listeners vs. Spotify's 62.6% — a meaningful audience. Apple listeners are typically older and more loyal. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Request Apple Podcast ratings and reviews from the congregation. Use Apple's "New Episodes" notifications by keeping art and description fresh seasonally.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Facebook/Instagram · Medium Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Reels massively outperform all other formats</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Reels: 9,847 views, 412 interactions vs. Photos: 1,855 views, 35 interactions. Reels are 5× more effective per post. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Repurpose every YouTube Short as an Instagram/Facebook Reel (same cut, add captions). This doubles reach for zero extra production. Target 4–5 Reels/week.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Facebook/Instagram · Medium Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">London is the #1 Facebook city — leverage community</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">London leads Facebook at 20% of followers. Jerusalem (4.2%), LA (2.2%), Tel Aviv (1.5%). The S&P Sephardic community in London is the core audience. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Create community-specific content (S&P community announcements, shiurim schedule). Tag local London Jewish organisations to boost organic reach.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">TikTok · High Impact</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">TikTok launched strong in Jan 2026 with immediate traction</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">From zero to 11,608 views in 52 days. Peak 1,071 views on Feb 13. Strong engagement: 257 likes, 20 comments, 11 shares. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Maintain 3–4 posts/week cadence. Focus on short, punchy theological hooks (15–30 seconds). Use trending audio when relevant to increase reach.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">TikTok · Strategic</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Cross-platform content repurposing drives efficiency</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">TikTok content can be repurposed as YouTube Shorts and Instagram Reels with minimal editing. The same 15–30 second clip works across all three platforms. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Create once, publish everywhere. Schedule TikTok → Instagram Reel → YouTube Short sequence within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-purple-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Cross-Platform · Strategic</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">The 25–34 male demographic is the core driver</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">YouTube: 25–34 males = 29% of views + 39.6% of watch time. Facebook: 35–44 males = 18.3%. This is the core growth demographic — professional Jewish men engaging with identity and meaning. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Title content with this audience in mind ("What Does it Mean to Be Jewish Today?", "Freedom Isn't What You Think"). These already top the podcast charts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="bg-purple-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Cross-Platform · Strategic</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">US audience (44%) is the largest untapped market</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">US = 44.7% of podcast listeners, 46% of YouTube views. Yet the core community is London. <strong class="text-white">Action:</strong> Create one US-facing episode per quarter engaging American Sephardic community, Jewish life in NYC/LA/Miami. Reach out to US Sephardic podcasts (Halacha Headlines, Jewish Unpacked) for cross-promotion.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Priority Matrix -->
    <div class="mt-4 border-t border-gray-700 pt-5 space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold">Prioritised Action List (Next 30 Days)</h3>
