        <li><strong class="text-amber-400">TikTok cadence</strong> – 3–4 TikToks/week (15–30 sec theological hooks). Cross-post to Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts within 24hrs.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-amber-400">Clip the parasha</strong> – Each weekly parasha episode → 2 YouTube Shorts + 2 Reels + 1 TikTok (1 theological hook, 1 practical application).</li>
        <li><strong class="text-amber-400">Current-events rapid response</strong> – When major Jewish/world news breaks, publish a short reflective video within 48hrs.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-amber-400">Apple Podcasts ratings campaign</strong> – Ask congregation to leave a review. Even 20–30 reviews significantly lifts Apple search placement.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-amber-400">Cross-promotion</strong> – Reach out to 2–3 US-based Jewish podcasts for guest appearances or episode swaps.</li>
      </ol>
