  <footer class="text-center text-xs text-gray-600 pb-6">
    Data sources: YouTube Studio (Feb 11–Mar 11, 2026) · Spotify for Creators (all-time through Mar 11, 2026) · Meta Business Suite (Mar 2025–Mar 2026) · TikTok Analytics (Jan 18–Mar 10, 2026).
    Active management started Feb 5, 2025.
  </footer>

</main>

